.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ずっと触ってるまりかよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今いちご大福にはまってるまりかよ。\nいちご大福めっっっちゃおいしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅうのタイトルに使われました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぁーーみゅーみゅーすきよーー\n清まってよかったああああぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエストの個人pvについてお話しますで:)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤万理華×柳沢翔\n『ナイフ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真冬のさむーい時に撮影をしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演劇部の女の子と男の子の文化祭でのお話です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん。\nひっかきキズ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアル"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔に傷をかくのは初めてでしたが、\n全く抵抗なくうれしかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔に傷てめっちゃかっこよい‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一日の半分はほっぺた\nこのままで過ごしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか特殊メイクとかしたいな..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね。\nこの衣装の制服も今ぽくなくてかわいかったです^^\n丸襟にひものリボン、短い靴下..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう制服だいすきっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影でいちばん大変だったのが、\n舞台のバラの中で倒れているシーンです。\n実は見えないところにカイロが隠れてるのよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\n脚とバラで隠れてるのだっ‼\nどうだ‼気づかなかったろうっっ‼\nはーはっはっはっは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育館の舞台で撮影したのですが、\nいちばん寒かったかも><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成した作品を見て感動。\n自分じゃないみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい素敵な作品です＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のために何人ものスタッフさんが\n協力してくださって、\nこんなに素敵な作品ができたんだと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中、頑張って本当によかったなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういやいつかの演技力テストは\nぐだぐだのちろちろりんだったわね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーノー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvを通して、\n演技の楽しさがわかりました‼\n演技ってすごい楽しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなドラマや映画観て学ぼうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見てない方は\nチェックよろしくなのよん:D♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日真洋の写真撮りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもしろすぎたので\nはいっ待ち受けはいっ採用‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にも真洋の写真見せて\nてコメントあったけど、、、あかん‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もあかーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"い\"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさが今日こわれてました。\n...困ったおねーちゃんや、もう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせのブログにれいかのこと書いてたけど、\nそうそう...\nれいかってどう表現したらいいか\nわからんかったんやけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうやっ!めんどくさいんや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかのペースに巻き込まれるとすごいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/6036656/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⁇\nノリ良すぎじゃーーーれいかたーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日も元気に頑張りまりかですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}}